  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n9 div [(1)/(2)+(1)/(3)+(1)/(4)+(1)/(6)div((3)/(4)-(1)/(3)) of (2)/(9)]\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nBODMAS rule (Bracket, Of, Division, Multiplication, Addition, Subtraction)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 9 div [(1)/(2) + (1)/(3) + (1)/(4) + (1)/(6) div ((9-4)/(12)) of (2)/(9)]\n\n⇒ 9 div [(1)/(2) + (1)/(3) + (1)/(4) + (1)/(6) div (5)/(12) of (2)/(9)]\n\n⇒ 9 div [(1)/(2) + (1)/(3) + (1)/(4) + (1)/(6) div ((5)/(12) times (2)/(9))]\n\n⇒ 9 div [(1)/(2) + (1)/(3) + (1)/(4) + (1)/(6) div (5)/(54)]\n\n⇒ 9 div [(1)/(2) + (1)/(3) + (1)/(4) + (1)/(6) times (54)/(5)]\n\n⇒ 9 div [(1)/(2) + (1)/(3) + (1)/(4) + (9)/(5)]\n\n⇒ 9 div [(30 + 20 + 15 + 108)/(60)]\n\n⇒ 9 div (173)/(60)\n\n⇒ 9 times (60)/(173)\n\n⇒ (540)/(173)\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (1).**</p",
